  (d) publish, share or distribute any Output -- for example a trained adapter or model on a model hub -- or use Output
      outside Personal Study or Academic Research, without the Licensor's prior written permission;
  (e) use the Software or any Output to build, improve or benchmark a product, library or service that competes with the
